Run the frozen hospital vocabulary's ordered all-pairs development scan. This
entry point is intentionally separate from ``plan_transitions.py --all``: the
latter retains its ten demonstration sentences, while this command owns 35 x
35 = 1,225 ordered pairs, including the 35 self-pairs.

